### CREATE Advertisement
POST http://localhost:8081/api/advertisements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java Course Advertisement",
  "description": "Learn Java programming with EduFrame",
  "advertiserName": "EduTech Lanka",
  "startDate": "2026-09-23",
  "endDate": "2026-10-23",
  "budget": 50000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
### GET all advertisements
GET http://localhost:8081/api/advertisements
Accept: application/json

###

### UPDATE Advertisement ID 1
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/advertisements/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Advanced Java Course Advertisement",
  "description": "Learn Advanced Java and Spring Boot with EduFrame",
  "advertiserName": "EduTech Lanka",
  "startDate": "2026-09-23",
  "endDate": "2026-11-30",
  "budget": 75000,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
###

### DELETE Advertisement ID 1
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/advertisements/1
###

